  "set_sources": {
    "en": "Letters: Vincent van Gogh (public domain). English and Korean are this app's own translations. Portraits: Van Gogh, Self-Portrait (1887, Art Institute of Chicago); Joseph Lange, Mozart (1782–83); Antoine-Jean Gros, Bonaparte at Arcole (1796); The Poet Bashō (c. 1820–40, Rijksmuseum). All public domain.",
